OL,3,ATime to focus on cost of living, says
OL,4,APM after US election results
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has said the results of
OL,7,Fthe US midterm elections meant there
OL,8,Fwas an "opportunity now to unite around
OL,9,Fthe issue that is affecting us all, and
OL,10,Fthat's the cost of living".
OL,12,FSpeaking to broadcasters from the
OL,13,FCommonwealth leaders summit, the prime
OL,14,Fminister promised to push for a
OL,15,Fresolution to the conflicts in the
OL,16,FMiddle East and Ukraine in the wake of
OL,17,Fthe US elections that saw Donald
OL,18,FTrump's Republicans suffer heavy
OL,19,Flosses.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
