OL,3,AUS midterm results a 'victory' for
OL,4,ACanadians hopeful of tariff relief
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was the midterm result that many in
OL,7,FCanada had hoped for - a Democratic
OL,8,Fsweep that was in part a repudiation by
OL,9,FAmerican voters of Donald Trump's
OL,10,Ftariff on close trade allies.
OL,12,F"I was doing cartwheels down the
OL,13,Fstreet," said Ontario Premier Doug Ford
OL,14,Fon Wednesday morning, calling it "a
OL,15,Fvictory for Canada".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
